body:
I get the following error when trying to set a max value on the rangeSlider widget:

`Uncaught Error: noUiSlider: 'range' value isn't numeric.`

The configuration is as follows:

```js
this.instantsearch.addWidget(
    instantsearch.widgets.rangeSlider({
        container: '#journeys-price-widget',
        attributeName: 'calculatedPrice',
        templates: {
            header: 'Price'
        },
        pips: false,
        max: 30000,
        tooltips: {
            format: function(formattedValue) {
                return 'A' + accounting.formatMoney(formattedValue);
            }
        }
    })
);
```
